('Tor Poznań', NULL, 'sport', 'The Poznań Circuit is a 4.083 km (2.537 mi) motorsport race track located in the Ławica area of Poznań, Poland. The circuit also has a small 1.509 km (0.938 mi) kart circuit layout. The circuit was resurfaced and renovated in 2006; as an FIA Grade 3 circuit, it is the only racing circuit homologated by the FIA in Poland.', NULL, '1h 30min', '€', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Pozna%C5%84_GP_layout.svg?width=1024', 52.4182408, 16.8069082, 'Wyścigowa, 62-081, Przeźmierowo, Poland', 'http://www.aw.poznan.pl/tor/', 'way/172189509', 'en:Poznań Circuit', 'Maggot666PL · CC BY-SA 3.0 (via Wikimedia Commons)', 'osm+wikipedia'),
